WEBVTT

01:36.460 --> 01:41.030
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.460 --> 01:43.850
[Episode 9]

01:58.710 --> 01:59.440
Big Brother.

02:06.280 --> 02:07.210
In our next life,

02:10.710 --> 02:13.190
let's be brothers again.

02:36.840 --> 02:37.630
Tang Rou!

02:44.870 --> 02:46.190
Tang Rou!

03:57.680 --> 03:58.940
How could this happen?

03:59.590 --> 04:01.190
How come I saved Tang Rou,

04:02.150 --> 04:03.560
but he still died?

04:03.290 --> 04:05.600
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

04:04.590 --> 04:06.870
Why couldn't I prevent all of this?

04:05.620 --> 04:10.330
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

04:10.590 --> 04:12.940
♪ The wind blows ♪

04:12.970 --> 04:17.410
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

04:18.010 --> 04:20.459
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

04:20.480 --> 04:22.950
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

04:22.970 --> 04:26.080
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

04:26.770 --> 04:34.050
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

04:38.070 --> 04:41.170
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

04:41.310 --> 04:44.530
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

04:45.480 --> 04:48.750
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

04:48.820 --> 04:51.810
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

04:52.990 --> 04:56.180
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

04:56.210 --> 04:59.940
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

05:00.380 --> 05:03.280
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

05:02.360 --> 05:03.270
Miss Tang Fang.

05:04.100 --> 05:06.340
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

05:05.870 --> 05:08.030
Thank you for your care along the way.

05:06.850 --> 05:08.830
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

05:08.850 --> 05:12.910
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

05:09.190 --> 05:11.630
This carriage and horse is a gift for you.

05:12.480 --> 05:13.600
The weather is hot.

05:14.390 --> 05:18.040
Tang Rou should be buried quickly.

05:14.570 --> 05:17.240
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

05:17.270 --> 05:20.730
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

05:19.000 --> 05:22.600
Please take him back
to the Tang Residence now.

05:21.320 --> 05:23.880
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

05:23.900 --> 05:28.150
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

05:25.120 --> 05:25.850
Old Madam Wu,

05:26.870 --> 05:29.720
could you please send someone

05:28.630 --> 05:31.070
♪ The wind blows ♪

05:30.240 --> 05:31.480
to take Tang Rou back
to the Tang Sect for me?

05:31.100 --> 05:36.020
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

05:35.950 --> 05:36.750
There are some matters

05:36.130 --> 05:38.370
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

05:37.159 --> 05:39.040
that I need to attend to for my family.

05:38.540 --> 05:41.159
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

05:40.190 --> 05:42.390
I'll need a few more days
before I can return.

05:41.180 --> 05:44.400
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

05:43.680 --> 05:44.680
In that case...

05:44.940 --> 05:51.280
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

05:45.830 --> 05:46.510
Jiang Yue.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.120
I'm here.

05:49.390 --> 05:52.190
Please make arrangements
as Miss Tang requested.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.000
Yes.

06:21.040 --> 06:23.020
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

06:23.040 --> 06:27.320
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

06:28.800 --> 06:31.600
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

06:31.630 --> 06:35.580
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

06:35.760 --> 06:38.150
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

06:38.170 --> 06:42.670
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

06:43.030 --> 06:45.230
♪ The wind blows ♪

06:45.320 --> 06:50.440
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

06:48.310 --> 06:49.000
Tang Rou.

06:50.340 --> 06:51.670
Let's be brothers in our next life.

06:50.470 --> 06:52.470
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

06:52.850 --> 06:55.409
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

06:55.440 --> 06:58.970
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

06:59.000 --> 07:06.710
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

07:09.250 --> 07:11.340
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

07:11.370 --> 07:13.580
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

07:14.000 --> 07:16.750
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

07:17.520 --> 07:23.550
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

07:21.600 --> 07:23.400
Madam, Feng Lang is awake.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.640
Let's visit him.

07:25.210 --> 07:32.909
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

07:35.270 --> 07:37.400
How serious are Feng Lang's injuries?

07:37.430 --> 07:38.680
The sword wound is deep,

07:38.680 --> 07:40.000
but it missed the vital organs,

07:40.000 --> 07:41.190
so it's not life-threatening.

07:41.190 --> 07:43.250
However, the palm strike to his chest

07:43.310 --> 07:46.159
has burned his heart
and lungs with internal energy,

07:46.159 --> 07:48.159
severing all his lung's meridians.

07:50.830 --> 07:51.560
Old Madam Wu,

07:52.120 --> 07:54.000
I can do nothing more for him.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.260
How could this happen?

08:00.720 --> 08:01.980
How could this happen?

08:05.870 --> 08:06.600
Mr. Xiao.

08:10.600 --> 08:11.660
Don't move around.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.480
It's useless.

08:18.830 --> 08:21.870
I suffered a serious injury as a child.

08:22.720 --> 08:24.750
Although a skilled master healed me,

08:24.750 --> 08:26.540
I was left with a chronic condition.

08:26.540 --> 08:27.940
Kang Chuyu's palm strike

08:29.240 --> 08:31.270
must have hit my old injury.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.460
Who was the master who healed you?

08:36.240 --> 08:37.970
We can send someone to find him.

08:40.480 --> 08:43.600
That master is a recluse.

08:44.440 --> 08:49.720
After saving me,
he declared our debt settled.

08:51.080 --> 08:52.210
Even if we found him,

08:52.850 --> 08:54.450
he would never help me again.

08:55.550 --> 08:56.320
Feng Lang.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.550
May I ask the name of that master?

09:00.150 --> 09:01.880
If he's from the martial world,

09:02.080 --> 09:03.510
I might be able to help.

09:06.440 --> 09:07.240
That master

09:10.000 --> 09:11.390
was Grand Master Dayin.

09:15.270 --> 09:16.670
But he wanders the world.

09:17.270 --> 09:20.670
No one knows where he is now.

09:21.510 --> 09:24.200
The Xiao family
has lost countless lives for me.

09:24.550 --> 09:27.390
Young hero Tang Rou died here.

09:28.150 --> 09:30.210
Young hero Feng is severely wounded.

09:30.240 --> 09:32.170
If you also die from your injuries,

09:32.670 --> 09:34.480
I won't be able to bear it.

09:40.000 --> 09:40.750
Mr. Zhang,

09:41.850 --> 09:43.420
I have a favor to ask.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.230
Please speak, Madam.

09:47.430 --> 09:49.430
Please take the Hero Command Token

09:50.230 --> 09:54.280
and bring young hero Feng
to find Grand Master Dayin.

09:55.840 --> 09:57.750
By making the request with the token,

09:57.750 --> 10:00.870
the righteous forces will surely help

10:01.400 --> 10:03.000
and search for him together.

10:03.750 --> 10:06.200
No, I can't allow it. I can't!

10:09.270 --> 10:10.000
Old Madam Wu.

10:11.510 --> 10:14.390
I'm escorting you to deliver this token.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.720
How can I use it for myself?

10:17.080 --> 10:18.360
The Hero Command Token

10:18.720 --> 10:20.240
was forged by the sect leaders

10:20.240 --> 10:22.510
of the Shaolin, Wudang, and Emei Sects.

10:23.150 --> 10:26.120
Its original purpose
was to save the country and its people,

10:26.120 --> 10:27.870
punish the evil, and promote the good.

10:27.870 --> 10:29.530
More than a decade has passed,

10:30.080 --> 10:32.470
yet it has brought nothing but bloodshed.

10:33.390 --> 10:37.120
Now, we can use
the Hero Command Token to save a life.

10:37.550 --> 10:40.600
This is the true meaning of its existence.

10:43.630 --> 10:44.760
Don't you all agree?

10:45.440 --> 10:46.240
That's right.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.750
-Young hero Feng.
-Old Madam Wu.

10:50.750 --> 10:51.960
Please don't refuse.

10:52.670 --> 10:53.320
Mr. Zhang,

10:54.390 --> 10:56.250
would you help me with this favor?

10:57.320 --> 10:58.720
As you wish, Old Madam Wu.

10:59.270 --> 11:01.790
It's a matter of life and death.
We cannot delay.

11:01.790 --> 11:02.440
Mr. Zhang,

11:03.550 --> 11:05.280
please depart this afternoon.

11:06.200 --> 11:06.670
Yes.

11:07.770 --> 11:13.170
I thank you for saving my life,
Old Madam Wu.

11:17.670 --> 11:19.000
Thank you, Old Madam Wu.

11:19.750 --> 11:20.670
Well then,

11:21.200 --> 11:23.030
Feng Lang, you should rest here.

11:23.770 --> 11:25.570
We won't disturb you any longer.

11:26.390 --> 11:26.920
Let's go.

11:36.020 --> 11:36.780
Old Madam Wu.

11:39.360 --> 11:41.290
I would like to accompany Mr. Zhang

11:41.790 --> 11:42.960
to escort Mr. Feng.

11:44.240 --> 11:46.840
Mr. Feng risked everything
to protect Old Madam Wu.

11:46.840 --> 11:47.720
Such heroism

11:47.720 --> 11:49.650
has earned my deepest admiration.

11:49.910 --> 11:52.110
I hope I can offer what little help I can.

11:52.510 --> 11:54.360
Besides, as a woman,

11:54.840 --> 11:56.770
I can take better care of invalids.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.150
On the journey,

11:58.150 --> 12:00.680
I can also be of great assistance
to Mr. Zhang.

12:02.360 --> 12:05.020
Since you're willing,
that would be wonderful.

12:06.790 --> 12:07.790
Go together then.

12:10.840 --> 12:11.550
Miss Tang.

12:14.710 --> 12:16.030
You have a pure heart

12:16.510 --> 12:17.910
and aren't good at lying.

12:18.120 --> 12:19.550
You are a kind young lady.

12:20.170 --> 12:23.450
No matter what, stay true to yourself.

12:33.180 --> 12:33.750
Father.

12:36.150 --> 12:37.880
Is your injury acting up again?

12:38.390 --> 12:40.720
I was severely wounded by Crazy Yan

12:38.640 --> 12:45.310
[Tang Yaoshun, Head of the Tang Sect]

12:40.720 --> 12:42.790
in the battle at Wuxing Mountain.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.000
Now,

12:44.840 --> 12:46.040
there's no other way.

12:46.270 --> 12:47.200
Perhaps only...

12:47.240 --> 12:49.370
Father, you mean the Voidheart Codex?

12:49.550 --> 12:51.350
The Voidheart Codex might work?

12:52.200 --> 12:55.460
But Crazy Yan disappeared
from the martial world long ago.

12:55.720 --> 12:56.960
Where can I find him?

12:57.270 --> 13:00.000
You don't necessarily need to
find Crazy Yan.

13:00.720 --> 13:03.550
The Voidheart Codex
has resurfaced in the martial world.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.440
As long as it's
the martial world's matter,

13:05.440 --> 13:07.640
the Jade Cicada of the Omniscience Door

13:07.840 --> 13:09.370
most likely knows about it.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.030
Father.

13:13.870 --> 13:15.670
I'll search the martial world
for rare treasures

13:15.670 --> 13:17.400
to open up the Omniscience Door

13:17.480 --> 13:19.280
and ask the Jade Cicada to speak.

13:20.510 --> 13:21.150
Fang.

13:23.390 --> 13:24.320
In the Tang Sect,

13:25.240 --> 13:28.700
even family members follow
the law of survival of the fittest.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.370
I am the family head,

13:31.320 --> 13:33.380
which is why our branch is respected.

13:35.130 --> 13:36.840
If news of my injury

13:36.870 --> 13:37.990
were to leak out,

13:40.150 --> 13:42.120
our branch would be doomed.

13:43.750 --> 13:46.240
Fang, I'm sorry for the burden.

13:47.080 --> 13:49.080
Only by finding the Voidheart Codex

13:49.200 --> 13:50.530
and healing my injuries

13:51.510 --> 13:53.080
will our branch have hope.

13:56.270 --> 13:56.910
Miss Tang.

13:57.900 --> 13:59.370
Go prepare your luggage first.

13:59.370 --> 14:02.050
Let's meet later at Mr. Feng's quarters.

14:20.460 --> 14:21.860
I won't die anytime soon.

14:23.270 --> 14:23.840
Mr. Xiao,

14:25.120 --> 14:27.320
you don't have to keep watching over me.

14:32.430 --> 14:35.030
I should have been the one
protecting Tang Rou,

14:36.120 --> 14:37.520
but he died because of me.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.000
Feng Lang...

14:47.150 --> 14:49.950
I just feel you're different
from what I expected,

14:50.550 --> 14:53.240
but you don't need to
risk your life to prove yourself.

14:53.240 --> 14:53.970
Don't worry.

14:55.630 --> 14:57.160
Since you call me Lucky Bag,

14:58.670 --> 15:00.330
I'll try my best to stay alive.

15:01.270 --> 15:02.440
When you need me,

15:03.320 --> 15:04.980
I'll bring you great fortune.

15:13.840 --> 15:14.570
Big Brother!

15:17.080 --> 15:17.810
Big Brother.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.600
Chaoran said
he's going to avenge Tang Rou.

15:19.600 --> 15:20.730
I couldn't stop him.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.360
You should get some rest first.

15:45.250 --> 15:46.270
-Where are you going?
-Chaoran.

15:46.270 --> 15:47.270
-Stop!
-Chaoran!

15:51.080 --> 15:51.550
You—

15:51.910 --> 15:53.770
Big Brother, don't try to stop me.

15:53.870 --> 15:55.150
I'm going to avenge Tang Rou!

15:55.150 --> 15:56.550
How do you plan to do that?

15:56.630 --> 15:57.790
I'll go back to Huanhua Sect

15:57.790 --> 15:59.440
and kill every Power Gang member I see!

15:59.440 --> 16:00.240
And then what?

16:03.840 --> 16:05.900
I don't care about the consequences.

16:06.320 --> 16:09.050
And then make me watch you
get killed by villains?

16:09.870 --> 16:11.530
Make me lose another brother?

16:16.510 --> 16:17.570
But Big Brother...

16:18.360 --> 16:19.490
I can't accept this.

16:20.510 --> 16:21.080
Get up.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.320
Get up!

16:35.910 --> 16:37.310
I can't accept it either.

16:41.670 --> 16:43.130
When I first met all of you,

16:45.390 --> 16:46.630
I swore

16:48.720 --> 16:49.920
to protect everyone.

16:57.000 --> 16:58.480
But I failed to do so.

17:02.840 --> 17:03.550
Brothers,

17:06.000 --> 17:07.460
acting rashly won't help.

17:08.980 --> 17:10.260
The only thing we can do

17:12.550 --> 17:14.440
is to find those responsible.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.410
We must avenge our fallen brothers

17:18.060 --> 17:19.380
and Tang Rou.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.450
Big Brother,

17:22.640 --> 17:24.550
the Power Gang is too powerful.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.220
If we want revenge,

17:27.550 --> 17:28.550
what should we do?

17:29.270 --> 17:30.470
How long must we wait?

17:42.270 --> 17:43.530
I know it's difficult.

17:48.310 --> 17:49.790
But I will make it happen.

17:53.170 --> 17:53.900
Big Brother,

17:55.880 --> 17:56.810
I believe in you.

17:57.410 --> 17:58.540
I believe in you too.

17:59.270 --> 18:01.000
We'll return to help the Xiao family now.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.440
The sooner we resolve their crisis,

18:02.440 --> 18:04.070
the sooner we can destroy the Power Gang

18:04.070 --> 18:05.200
and avenge Tang Rou.

18:05.830 --> 18:06.400
Alright.

18:07.750 --> 18:10.240
The Hailin Sect is far away,

18:10.510 --> 18:12.720
but our western branch borders Chuanjin.

18:12.720 --> 18:13.640
I'll go back now

18:14.200 --> 18:15.660
and ask my father for help.

18:15.880 --> 18:17.750
Uncle Qu Jianchi is also at Sword Manor.

18:17.750 --> 18:19.350
I'll go to the Qu family for help now.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.240
The Qu sisters

18:20.270 --> 18:22.600
can also bring more friends from the west.

18:27.200 --> 18:27.930
Big Brother,

18:29.350 --> 18:30.750
this is my favorite wine.

18:31.270 --> 18:32.130
You can have it.

18:33.270 --> 18:34.530
Take care of yourself.

18:43.720 --> 18:44.850
Alright, brothers.

18:46.340 --> 18:47.870
Be careful on your journey,

18:50.110 --> 18:52.910
lest you encounter
that villain Kang Chuyu again.

18:53.000 --> 18:54.070
Speaking of him,

18:54.370 --> 18:56.170
he truly makes my blood run cold.

18:56.200 --> 18:58.640
I can't believe he's
the Power Gang's lackey.

18:58.640 --> 18:59.240
To think

19:00.000 --> 19:02.330
we called him Uncle Kang
for so many years.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.880
My elders said he practiced

19:03.880 --> 19:06.350
the ice cultivation technique
to unleash the Frost Stone's power

19:06.350 --> 19:07.750
in his Sun-Gazing Sword.

19:07.820 --> 19:09.400
His inner energy is as cold as ice.

19:09.400 --> 19:11.800
They wanted me to learn his determination.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.570
It's unbelievable.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.760
Big Brother, it's settled then.

19:17.350 --> 19:18.210
We'll leave now

19:18.680 --> 19:20.810
to avenge Tang Rou as soon as possible.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.170
Big Brother,

19:23.270 --> 19:23.870
take care.

19:24.720 --> 19:25.350
Take care.

19:27.070 --> 19:27.670
Take care.

19:38.640 --> 19:40.110
My elders said he practiced

19:40.110 --> 19:42.640
the ice cultivation technique
to unleash the Frost Stone's power

19:42.640 --> 19:44.040
in his Sun-Gazing Sword.

19:44.240 --> 19:46.100
His inner energy is as cold as ice.

19:49.900 --> 19:51.160
Though the sword wound is deep,

19:51.160 --> 19:52.350
it missed the vital points,

19:52.350 --> 19:53.480
so it's not serious.

19:53.680 --> 19:55.350
But the palm strike to his chest

19:55.350 --> 19:57.920
has burned his heart
and lungs with internal energy,

19:57.920 --> 19:59.920
severing all his lung's meridians.

20:08.790 --> 20:10.520
I'll treat your illness first.

20:10.540 --> 20:13.800
I'll find another chance
to borrow the Hero Command Token.

20:14.350 --> 20:15.750
Old Madam Wu is merciful.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.400
She will understand.

20:30.960 --> 20:34.350
I heard this was crafted
by foreign artisans.

20:34.590 --> 20:35.590
It has two layers.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.650
The inner layer holds the item.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.900
The outer layer
is filled with liquid gold.

20:39.900 --> 20:41.480
If not for this clever design,

20:41.480 --> 20:42.200
last night,

20:42.400 --> 20:45.600
the Hero Command Token
would've been stolen by villains.

20:50.070 --> 20:50.750
Mr. Zhang,

20:50.880 --> 20:52.160
are you opening it now?

20:52.880 --> 20:54.030
After yesterday's fight,

20:54.030 --> 20:55.440
I'm worried the box might be damaged.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.970
If it broke, the liquid gold

20:57.400 --> 20:59.530
could destroy the Hero Command Token.

21:20.590 --> 21:22.720
"Behold the divine token of mystery."

21:23.000 --> 21:25.060
“All heroes shall bow immediately.”

21:25.680 --> 21:26.310
This is—

21:35.130 --> 21:36.860
This is the Hero Command Token.

21:39.070 --> 21:40.440
Let me keep it safe.

21:41.110 --> 21:42.370
You faked your injury.

21:42.960 --> 21:45.710
Mr. Zhang's wounds
aren't that serious either.

21:46.270 --> 21:47.840
Old Madam Wu is kind-hearted,

21:47.840 --> 21:49.770
but I've been wary of you all along.

21:50.320 --> 21:51.320
It was indeed you.

21:52.000 --> 21:52.830
So what?

22:04.310 --> 22:05.510
What did you do to her?

22:06.050 --> 22:07.450
Dream-binding incense.

22:28.740 --> 22:29.950
Who are you really?

22:31.240 --> 22:32.310
Fifteen years ago,

22:33.510 --> 22:35.310
you were among those

22:36.070 --> 22:38.470
who destroyed Baicao Valley, weren't you?

22:39.160 --> 22:40.400
It seems I'm right.

22:41.590 --> 22:42.350
Mr. Zhang.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.570
It's been 15 years.

22:45.450 --> 22:47.800
It's time to settle this debt.

23:06.240 --> 23:06.960
It's done.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.350
I'll take this girl with me first.

23:09.350 --> 23:11.150
The rest can be discussed later.

23:23.430 --> 23:25.030
What's wrong with Tang Fang?

23:27.170 --> 23:28.230
She's just sleepy.

23:41.680 --> 23:43.410
Why are you able to get up again?

23:45.350 --> 23:46.750
My injuries are healing.

23:47.000 --> 23:48.930
Shouldn't you be happy about that?

23:49.440 --> 23:51.100
Your injuries are healing...

23:51.440 --> 23:52.240
I am happy.

23:53.200 --> 23:55.660
Kang Chuyu practices cold internal energy.

23:56.880 --> 23:58.740
Your lung meridians were burned.

23:59.310 --> 24:03.030
So, you've been acting all along.

24:03.830 --> 24:04.310
Yes.

24:06.590 --> 24:07.390
Xiao Qiushui.

24:09.070 --> 24:10.160
I'm here to take

24:11.030 --> 24:13.360
the Hero Command Token for the Power Gang.

24:15.350 --> 24:16.510
No wonder you said

24:17.550 --> 24:19.410
the world is united by interests.

24:21.000 --> 24:23.660
So you've been bought by
the Power Gang long ago.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.510
Mr. Xiao,

24:26.070 --> 24:29.670
do you really think I've been
deliberately hiding this from you?

24:38.820 --> 24:40.510
You've always called me Lucky Bag.

24:40.510 --> 24:43.000
Are you satisfied with this luck now?

24:47.550 --> 24:48.280
Disgusting.

24:49.640 --> 24:50.570
The Xiao family,

24:51.070 --> 24:52.070
the Huanhua Sect,

24:52.640 --> 24:54.100
and your father Xiao Xilou

24:54.590 --> 24:56.450
are the truly hypocritical ones.

24:56.590 --> 24:58.050
You're talking nonsense.

24:58.070 --> 24:59.400
My father is honorable.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.420
He sacrificed himself

25:02.030 --> 25:03.240
to protect others.

25:04.480 --> 25:05.410
You have no right

25:06.960 --> 25:08.550
to judge my father.

25:09.310 --> 25:11.110
He appears righteous in public,

25:12.000 --> 25:15.480
but you have no idea
how many dirty, disgusting things

25:16.110 --> 25:17.440
he's done in private.

25:19.070 --> 25:20.120
Your face

25:22.070 --> 25:23.470
is even more disgusting.

25:24.090 --> 25:25.680
You disloyal snake!

25:27.880 --> 25:29.070
Disloyal?

25:30.460 --> 25:33.350
Do you really think
there is loyalty in this world?

25:34.750 --> 25:36.480
We made a bet in Lingliang Town.

25:36.870 --> 25:38.260
I want to show you

25:38.400 --> 25:40.680
whether people in the martial world
gather for interests

25:40.680 --> 25:41.830
or chivalry.

25:43.480 --> 25:44.880
At that point, you'll see

25:45.030 --> 25:46.160
how ridiculous and pitiful

25:46.160 --> 25:47.070
the Xiao family,

25:47.070 --> 25:47.870
your parents,

25:48.640 --> 25:51.000
and you truly are.

26:48.810 --> 26:49.330
Master,

26:49.880 --> 26:52.210
General Wu Jie's troops will be here soon.

27:11.880 --> 27:12.680
Fortunately,

27:14.030 --> 27:14.790
I have

27:16.460 --> 27:17.550
not failed

27:19.000 --> 27:20.330
Rou's trust.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.480
Xiao Qiushui.

27:40.510 --> 27:41.310
Xiao Qiushui.

27:47.120 --> 27:47.960
Xiao Qiushui!

27:57.360 --> 27:57.990
Master.

28:02.400 --> 28:04.000
Master, if you want revenge,

28:04.070 --> 28:05.720
I'll find an opportunity another day

28:05.720 --> 28:07.250
to kill both of them for you.

28:14.270 --> 28:15.330
Listen carefully.

28:16.550 --> 28:18.010
If you dare harm Tang Fang,

28:18.830 --> 28:20.030
I will take your life.

28:22.070 --> 28:23.200
Forgive me, Master.

28:24.400 --> 28:25.880
I didn't know before

28:26.440 --> 28:28.550
that Miss Tang was so important to you.

28:28.550 --> 28:29.240
I'll give orders immediately

28:29.240 --> 28:30.970
that no one is to harm Miss Tang.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.200
Xiao Qiushui,

28:34.270 --> 28:35.800
I'll spare your life today.

28:36.270 --> 28:39.240
Wait until you see this living hell
with your own eyes.

28:39.240 --> 28:39.880
Then

28:41.070 --> 28:45.130
let's see if you still believe in
the righteousness of the martial world.

28:47.240 --> 28:48.040
Song Mingzhu.

28:50.030 --> 28:52.230
Now that we have the Hero Command Token,

28:53.160 --> 28:54.890
the siege on Xiao's Sword Manor

28:55.070 --> 28:56.330
will only get tighter.

28:56.550 --> 28:58.410
Once their water supply runs out,

28:59.000 --> 29:00.970
I will personally enter the Sword Manor.

29:00.970 --> 29:05.760
I'll drag Xiao Xilou's corpse
to Baicao Valley as a sacrifice.

29:08.400 --> 29:08.920
Yes.

29:10.360 --> 29:10.960
Master.

29:17.400 --> 29:19.710
I know you don't like
the bitter taste of the Stone Pine Pills,

29:19.710 --> 29:21.550
but you used
the Turtle Snake Hibernation technique

29:21.550 --> 29:22.680
to fake a lung injury,

29:22.680 --> 29:24.610
which is very harmful to your body.

29:24.880 --> 29:27.140
You should take a pill
to recover faster.

29:27.680 --> 29:28.480
Song Mingzhu,

29:30.510 --> 29:31.310
you only need to do

29:31.310 --> 29:32.910
what I've assigned you to do.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.560
Don't worry about things

29:35.510 --> 29:36.640
that you shouldn't.

29:47.350 --> 29:47.880
Yes.

29:50.550 --> 29:52.210
Those in the gang who oppose me

29:53.160 --> 29:54.760
must be rooted out one by one.

29:55.110 --> 29:56.790
Otherwise, they'll truly forget

29:56.790 --> 29:59.050
that I, Liu Suifeng, am the Deputy Chief.

29:59.270 --> 30:00.200
Back to the gang.

30:19.390 --> 30:22.320
-Greetings, Old Madam Wu!
-Greetings, Old Madam Wu!

30:34.770 --> 30:36.630
Why have you brought an army here?

30:37.440 --> 30:38.300
Where is my son?

30:38.640 --> 30:39.370
Old Madam Wu,

30:39.720 --> 30:41.830
a month ago,
the imperial court issued a decree

30:41.830 --> 30:43.720
falsely accusing the General
of failing to defend the pass.

30:43.720 --> 30:45.590
They imprisoned him inside the fortress.

30:45.590 --> 30:47.000
We are all the General's former troops.

30:47.000 --> 30:50.130
We left the army
and hid in the mountains with our forces.

30:56.830 --> 30:57.550
Rise.

30:58.270 --> 30:58.790
Rise!

31:01.830 --> 31:03.640
You are still soldiers of Daxi.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.590
How could you desert?

31:06.210 --> 31:07.310
When General Wu was here,

31:07.310 --> 31:09.110
we were the swords that protected Daxi.

31:09.110 --> 31:10.440
But with General Wu gone,

31:10.440 --> 31:12.640
they want to reassign us
as menial laborers.

31:12.640 --> 31:13.570
Once disbanded,

31:13.640 --> 31:15.550
this elite fighting force
will cease to exist.

31:15.550 --> 31:17.080
Only if you save the General

31:17.350 --> 31:19.480
will there be hope for defending Daxi.

31:21.840 --> 31:22.970
The emperor's order

31:23.640 --> 31:25.070
cannot be defied.

31:25.720 --> 31:27.780
Old Madam Wu, you have a noble status.

31:27.960 --> 31:29.160
If you plead his case,

31:29.640 --> 31:31.560
there'll be a chance
to save the General from danger.

31:31.560 --> 31:33.560
We await General Wu's exoneration!

31:35.510 --> 31:39.640
-We await General Wu's exoneration!
-We await General Wu's exoneration!

31:46.270 --> 31:47.000
Old Madam Wu,

31:47.200 --> 31:47.960
given the circumstances,

31:47.960 --> 31:49.350
please grant their request.

31:49.350 --> 31:50.480
If we send them back,

31:50.510 --> 31:53.400
these hundreds of cavalry
will surely lose their lives.

31:53.400 --> 31:55.060
It would be a tragedy for Daxi.

31:56.070 --> 31:56.680
So be it.

31:58.070 --> 31:59.070
Everyone, rise.

32:01.920 --> 32:03.720
I'll risk these old bones of mine

32:04.240 --> 32:05.900
and make a trip to the capital.

32:06.160 --> 32:08.960
-Thank you, Old Madam Wu!
-Thank you, Old Madam Wu!

32:24.750 --> 32:25.440
Tang Rou.

32:27.920 --> 32:28.590
Tang Rou.

32:29.590 --> 32:31.190
Your sister will be alright.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.660
Your sister will definitely be alright.

32:37.720 --> 32:38.830
She'll be alright.

32:43.350 --> 32:44.000
I'm here.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.270
I'm fine.

33:01.720 --> 33:02.920
How are his injuries?

33:03.240 --> 33:05.200
Old Madam Wu, his injuries are serious,

33:05.200 --> 33:06.510
but none are life-threatening.

33:06.510 --> 33:08.640
He'll recover after a few days of rest.

33:19.660 --> 33:21.970
Old Madam Wu, Mr. Zhang...

33:23.880 --> 33:24.680
Fortunately,

33:25.070 --> 33:27.150
Mr. Zhang's heart meridian
is positioned to the left,

33:27.150 --> 33:28.870
so he managed to survive.

33:30.110 --> 33:31.110
It's just that...

33:31.590 --> 33:36.030
I'm afraid he may never
be able to wield a sword again.

33:50.700 --> 33:53.550
[Power Gang]

34:01.050 --> 34:03.300
[Deep Spring Serenity]

34:15.510 --> 34:16.710
Who dares to be so bold?

34:16.710 --> 34:17.230
Indeed.

34:19.230 --> 34:20.550
The Chief is in seclusion.

34:20.550 --> 34:23.230
Who dares to strike
the God-Gathering Drum?

34:20.650 --> 34:24.239
[Ju Xiushan]
[Power Gang's Water King]

34:23.909 --> 34:24.540
It's me.

34:31.639 --> 34:34.400
-Greetings, Deputy Chief Liu.
-Greetings, Deputy Chief Liu.

34:34.400 --> 34:36.190
I've gathered you all here today

34:36.190 --> 34:38.010
because there's something
I don't understand

34:38.010 --> 34:41.090
and I need your advice.

34:44.310 --> 34:46.770
While I was tracking
the Hero Command Token,

34:46.790 --> 34:50.580
the Sword King's people
interfered in Lingliang Town.

34:51.040 --> 34:54.000
[Mo Feiyuan, Power Gang's Herbal King]
[Deng Yuping, Power Gang's Human King]

34:51.710 --> 34:55.070
The Iron Cavalry Demon Yan Guigui
also suddenly appeared,

34:54.670 --> 34:56.449
[Elder, Power Gang's Snake King]
[Chi Li, Snake King Maiden]

34:55.710 --> 34:56.960
disrupting my plans.

34:56.770 --> 34:58.910
[Lord Yin, Power Gang's Ghost King]
[Zhao Qiuxi, Power Gang's Blade King]

34:58.230 --> 34:59.110
I want to know

35:00.110 --> 35:03.510
if the Sword King is
deliberately opposing me.

35:09.710 --> 35:12.040
Did you receive orders from the Sword King

35:12.070 --> 35:14.000
to intercept me in Lingliang Town,

35:14.510 --> 35:17.440
and send Iron Cavalry Demon Yan Guigui
and Kang Chuyu

35:18.110 --> 35:20.510
to steal Old Madam Wu's
Hero Command Token?

35:22.320 --> 35:23.150
I... I...

35:23.150 --> 35:25.350
It has nothing to do with the Sword King.

35:26.070 --> 35:26.960
It was me.

35:29.690 --> 35:31.220
Gang rule number 14 states:

35:31.710 --> 35:32.840
All internal orders

35:32.880 --> 35:35.150
must be approved
by the Chief or Deputy Chief

35:35.150 --> 35:36.610
before being passed down.

35:36.920 --> 35:37.630
Ju Xiushan,

35:38.670 --> 35:40.000
do you admit your guilt?

35:42.190 --> 35:43.320
The rules also state

35:44.030 --> 35:46.880
that only those of Heavenly King rank
may enter Xixian Hall.

35:46.880 --> 35:47.880
Deputy Chief Liu,

35:48.240 --> 35:50.240
you brought this messenger up here.

35:50.360 --> 35:52.290
Aren't you breaking the rules too?

35:52.670 --> 35:53.730
Let's be flexible.

35:54.630 --> 35:55.480
That's right.

35:56.080 --> 35:58.000
We're all brothers here.

35:58.280 --> 36:00.480
-Why...
-Herbal King, no need to mediate.

36:00.480 --> 36:02.340
I follow the rules most strictly.

36:02.480 --> 36:05.740
Only those above Heavenly King rank
may enter Xixian Hall.

36:06.290 --> 36:07.750
This refers to the living.

36:08.240 --> 36:09.670
Dead men don't matter.

36:24.880 --> 36:25.880
Deputy Chief Liu,

36:26.400 --> 36:29.130
the Eight Kings
respect the Sword King above all.

36:29.190 --> 36:33.000
Perhaps we should discuss
today's matter later?

36:33.610 --> 36:36.140
The God-Gathering Drum
has already sounded.

36:36.370 --> 36:38.670
The Sword King and Fire King
haven't arrived yet.

36:38.670 --> 36:39.920
As Deputy Chief,

36:40.710 --> 36:42.640
it's appropriate for me to fulfill

36:43.230 --> 36:44.630
the Sword King's duties.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.710
Even if I've committed some offense,

36:46.710 --> 36:47.960
according to our rules,

36:47.960 --> 36:50.440
I'd only be confined to
the Reflection Prison for half a month.

36:50.440 --> 36:52.040
That's just the first point.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.030
Second,

36:55.670 --> 36:58.230
your subordinate, Fu Tianyi,
the Iron-Fisted Demon,

36:58.230 --> 37:00.320
extorted money
from the Gold and Silver Bank

37:00.320 --> 37:02.050
and colluded with our enemies.

37:02.920 --> 37:03.760
Third,

37:04.360 --> 37:05.760
outside Xiangyang City,

37:06.030 --> 37:08.230
Purple Phoenix and her accomplices

37:08.510 --> 37:09.670
poisoned me first

37:09.670 --> 37:11.280
and then tried to assassinate me.

37:11.280 --> 37:13.760
You can't escape from this today.

37:14.110 --> 37:14.880
Liu Suifeng,

37:15.510 --> 37:17.570
Purple Phoenix is your subordinate.

37:17.760 --> 37:19.560
What does this have to do with me?

37:21.920 --> 37:23.380
Everyone above the Eight Kings

37:23.380 --> 37:26.240
has taken the golden Misery Pill
given by the Chief.

37:26.550 --> 37:28.000
If one kills another,

37:28.480 --> 37:30.010
the Misery Pill will break.

37:30.280 --> 37:33.230
The oath-breaker
will immediately suffer severe injuries,

37:33.230 --> 37:35.090
and others may then execute them.

37:35.400 --> 37:37.960
You think I can't do anything to you,

37:38.400 --> 37:40.360
which is why you're so arrogant.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.440
But don't forget.

37:42.910 --> 37:46.110
One can attack without intending to kill.

37:58.850 --> 38:01.530
[Li Chenzhou]
[Power Gang's Supreme Chief]

37:59.280 --> 38:01.670
Greetings, Chief and Chieftess.

38:04.940 --> 38:07.450
[Zhao Shirong]
[Power Gang's Flowing Cloud Sleeve]

38:06.550 --> 38:09.350
The Chief is in seclusion
and cannot be disturbed.

38:09.520 --> 38:10.650
Don't you know that?

38:11.440 --> 38:13.920
Chief, Chieftess,
I have something to report.

38:13.920 --> 38:16.120
Liu Suifeng has been arrogant for years

38:16.440 --> 38:18.400
and now he's even
falsely accusing his subordinates.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.960
Please investigate this matter, Chief.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.110
Both the Chief and I

38:21.440 --> 38:23.240
heard what you all said earlier.

38:23.440 --> 38:25.150
You know the rules of our gang.

38:25.880 --> 38:28.410
Accusations without evidence
mean nothing.

38:28.670 --> 38:29.920
I have evidence.

38:42.050 --> 38:43.570
[To Water King]

38:49.780 --> 38:50.710
Everyone, rise.

38:50.950 --> 38:51.950
Thank you, Chief.

38:53.040 --> 38:55.930
This is a secret message
from Fu Tianyi to me.

38:56.440 --> 38:59.400
The letter states
that Liu Suifeng secretly colluded with

38:59.400 --> 39:02.440
Zhu the Great King
from the Twelve Chain Dock Waterway.

39:02.440 --> 39:04.190
But shortly after sending this letter,

39:04.190 --> 39:06.030
Liu Suifeng used someone else

39:06.480 --> 39:07.510
to kill Fu Tianyi.

39:07.800 --> 39:11.070
Now he's instead accusing Fu Tianyi
of conspiring with outsiders.

39:11.070 --> 39:14.110
It's clearly Liu Suifeng
who wants to eliminate opposition

39:14.110 --> 39:15.910
and seize power within our gang.

39:20.510 --> 39:22.320
Chief, Shirong,

39:24.360 --> 39:25.400
I didn't do it.

39:27.550 --> 39:28.400
Ju Xiushan.

39:28.960 --> 39:29.760
Here.

39:30.670 --> 39:33.480
This letter is full of nonsense.

39:33.840 --> 39:35.370
It's nothing significant.

39:35.670 --> 39:36.230
Yes.

39:37.280 --> 39:37.960
Suifeng.

39:38.740 --> 39:39.340
Chief.

39:40.160 --> 39:42.160
About Purple Phoenix and Fu Tianyi,

39:42.510 --> 39:44.510
you shouldn't blame Xiushan for it.

39:45.840 --> 39:46.510
Yes.

39:47.840 --> 39:49.550
I have something to ask you.

39:51.100 --> 39:53.590
You led men to besiege Xiao's Sword Manor.

39:54.670 --> 39:56.330
Such a large-scale operation

39:56.510 --> 39:58.030
has cost us many men.

39:58.280 --> 39:59.340
What was it all for?

40:00.100 --> 40:00.790
Chief,

40:01.550 --> 40:04.710
it was for the Hero Command Token.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.820
When I learned that Old Madam Wu

40:08.820 --> 40:10.480
was at the Xiao's Sword Manor,

40:11.150 --> 40:13.360
I didn't have time to report this to you

40:14.020 --> 40:16.620
before sending men
to besiege the Sword Manor.

40:21.990 --> 40:24.430
Where is the token now?

40:58.710 --> 40:59.670
Crazy Yan,

41:00.320 --> 41:02.760
hand over the Hero Command Token.

41:06.450 --> 41:10.070
[Crazy Yan]
[Top fighter of the martial world]

41:21.470 --> 41:22.440
Crazy Yan!

41:22.890 --> 41:24.710
You've killed too many this time.

41:24.710 --> 41:26.840
The token cannot remain in your hands.

41:28.400 --> 41:29.730
Do you refuse to submit?

41:33.230 --> 41:35.920
Even if all 16 sects attack me today,

41:36.590 --> 41:39.230
it'll just mean a dozen more corpses.

41:42.630 --> 41:43.150
Fine!

41:45.360 --> 41:47.070
I'll take you all on today.

41:48.510 --> 41:50.190
If anyone can take

41:50.360 --> 41:52.090
the Hero Command Token from me,

41:52.440 --> 41:54.040
I'll honor them as a real man.

41:54.920 --> 41:57.520
I'll not only hand over
the Hero Command Token,

41:57.670 --> 42:01.440
but also give him the Voidheart Codex.

42:09.880 --> 42:11.920
If you can't defeat me,

42:12.900 --> 42:16.490
you'll all follow my orders from now on!
